                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[H1] Experienced on the Oculus Rift with Xbox One Controller and keyboard and mouse [/H1]\n\nThis is one of the worst games on Steam VR. I really can't find anything nice to say about it. The graphics are bad. The sounds are bad. The gameplay is bad. The game is buggy. Even starting the game was a pain. You have to view to gaze and press down on your left mouse button. Then you can use your Xbox controller. Seriously.\n\nThere's no sense of speed. You go around this elliptical race track. It's the same track, day or night are your options. Random stuff happens along the way. Some dude runs on the track and takes you out. What? You can go in reverse for whatever reason. Everything is ugly to look at. The ground, the air, the people in the stands, everything. Maybe the horses are not that bad looking, but they don't look great either. And I experienced several glitches, including having to manually exit out of the game by alt tabbing and closing down the game window.\n\nJust avoid this game. DO NOT BUY. Don't even download for free. \n\nRate 2/10.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1524547068,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1524547068,
