                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "The experience of the game is always very personal and I appreciate your appreciations.\nIn VR games with open-space scenes, some graphic quality elements must be reduced to be rendered at 90 fps.\nThe characters and objects that appear precisely serve to add complexity to the game. And the race in the maximum circus is a race in an elliptical circuit where after 7 laps it ends.\nWe are improving the game for future versions, where you can use the VR controllers.\nThanks",
